1
00:00:00,089 --> 00:00:03,409
Choose the life that lets you sleep peacefully at night.

2
00:00:03,409 --> 00:00:06,611
Not the loud one. Not the one that impresses everyone.

3
00:00:06,611 --> 00:00:10,227
Choose the one that makes your heart quiet when the day ends.

4
00:00:10,227 --> 00:00:12,659
Peace is expensive, but chaos costs more.

5
00:00:12,659 --> 00:00:14,615
What are you choosing these days?

